			"notes": "### Fixed\n- **Your chat channel is remembered.** Switching servers (for example `/hub` or `/warp`), reconnecting or restarting the game no longer resets the channel buttons to *Normal*. Hypixel keeps your channel in all of these cases, so before this fix the buttons could show *Normal* while your messages still went to guild or party chat. The buttons now always show the channel Hypixel really uses."
		},
