			"notes": "First release, for Minecraft 26.2 and 26.3 (Fabric).\n\n- Channel buttons above the chat input: Normal, Party, Guild and Co-op, plus your own command buttons.\n  The active channel is highlighted and follows Hypixel's channel messages.\n- Player heads in guild, party, co-op, private message, Party Finder and SkyBlock chat, also for players who are\n  not in your lobby.\n- Chat history of 1000 messages (100–10000), longer sent message history, optional \"keep chat on disconnect\".\n- Chat peek: hold Left Alt to see the whole chat without opening it; the mouse wheel scrolls it.\n- Settings screen with `/chatplus`, a ⚙ button in chat and Mod Menu support.\n- English and Turkish translations."
